.Dd October 30, 2026
.Dt NEWFS_EXFAT 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm newfs_exfat
.Nd make an exFAT file system
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl N
.Op Fl v Ar name
.Op Fl b Ar bytes-per-sector
.Op Fl c Ar bytes-per-cluster
.Op Fl I Ar volume-id
.Ar special
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
makes an exFAT file system on a disk, a partition or an image file: the
boot region and its backup, one FAT, and the cluster heap with the
allocation bitmap, the up-case table and an empty root directory.
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl N
Shows the layout without writing it.
.It Fl v Ar name
The volume's name, up to 11 characters.
.It Fl b Ar bytes-per-sector
512 to 4096; by default the disk's.
.It Fl c Ar bytes-per-cluster
A power of two up to 32 MB; by default 4 KB up to 256 MB, 32 KB up to
32 GB, and 128 KB above.
.It Fl I Ar volume-id
The volume's serial number; by default one from the time.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0 on success, 1 on failure.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr fsck_exfat 8 ,
.Xr newfs_msdos 8
.Sh STANDARDS
Microsoft's exFAT file system specification.
.Sh HISTORY
This
.Nm
was written for Minkar.
